        "generatedLyrics": "[Intro]\n\n[Verse]\nDusty case on the floor\nI don't play it anymore\nFingertips are feeling sore\nWaiting for a little more\nWalking through an open door\nSearching for the hidden core\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nWait for the resonance\nFinding the evidence\nOf a love that didn't last\nEchoes from the distant past\n\n[Chorus]\nNylon heart\nTorn apart\nStrumming in the dark\nEvery spark\nLeaves a mark\nOn this hollow wood\nWish I could\nBe understood\n\n[Verse]\nSpanish cedar, ancient smell\nSecrets that I'll never tell\nTuning pegs are slipping fast\nHow long can the music last?\nPolished finish, amber glow\nWatching all the shadows grow\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nWait for the resonance\nFinding the evidence\nOf a love that didn't last\nEchoes from the distant past\n\n[Chorus]\nNylon heart\nTorn apart\nStrumming in the dark\nEvery spark\nLeaves a mark\nOn this hollow wood\nWish I could\nBe understood\n\n[Hook]\nPluck the wire\nHigher and higher\nLight the fire\nSoul's desire\n\n[Bridge]\nFrets are worn and silver grey\nChasing notes that fly away\nThumb against the heavy bass\nTrying to find a steady pace\nTremolo and heavy sighs\nLooking through a stranger's eyes\n\n[Build-up]\nCan you hear the sound?\nLifting off the ground\nComing back around\nLost and never found\n\n[Chorus]\nNylon heart\nTorn apart\nStrumming in the dark\nEvery spark\nLeaves a mark\nOn this hollow wood\nWish I could\nBe understood\n\n[Post-Chorus]\nNylon heart\nTorn apart\nStrumming in the dark\nEvery spark\nLeaves a mark\n\n[Outro]",
